nded their own account.\\r\\nThis is a merchant-initiated action to temporarily pause services.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"jurisdiction\":{\"description\":\"The jurisdiction the merchant entity is incorporated or established in.\",\"enum\":[\"IE\",\"UK\",\"EU\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"logoUrlPng\":{\"description\":\"The CDN URL of the merchant's logo in PNG format.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"logoUrlSvg\":{\"description\":\"The CDN URL of the merchant's logo in SVG format.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"merchantCategoryCode\":{\"description\":\"The industry code that represents the merchant's primary trading activity.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"The registered business name of the merchant.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"notes\":{\"description\":\"The notes field is an optional free text field that can be used to store any additional information about the merchant.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"parentMerchant\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"format\":\"uuid\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"paymentAccountLimit\":{\"description\":\"The maximum number of payment accounts that can be created for the Merchant.\\r\\nTo increase the limit contact support.\",\"format\":\"int32\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"paymentAccounts\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"accountName\":{\"description\":\"Name for the account\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"accountSupplierName\":{\"description\":\"The payment account supplier name. A payment account can be supplied by multiple payment processors.\",\"enum\":[\"None\",\"CyberSource\",\"Checkout\",\"Stripe\",\"Modulr\",\"Plaid\",\"Yapily\",\"Nofrixion\",\"Bitcoin\",\"BitcoinTestnet\",\"BankingCircle\",\"BankingCircleAgency\",\"Simulator\",\"Lightning\",\"LightningTestnet\",\"BankingCircleDirectDebit\",\"Technoxander\"],\"type\":\